       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          UTCUPMENU.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        4/20/90.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *REMARKS.   UPDATE GLOBAL MENU SYSTEM WITH NEW SYSTEM RELEASE.
      *
      *    THIS PROGRAM UPDATES THE GLOBAL MENU SYSTEM FILES WITH
      *    NEW AND/OR CHANGED TRANSACTIONS FOR A NEW SYSTEM RELEASE.
      *    THE NEW MENU SYSTEM FILES ARE KEPT IN THE APPLICATION'S
      *    LIBRARY (SAY, 'MCPRD' FOR CSIS/MMIS), AND RESTORED FROM
      *    TAPE.  THEN ANY NEW TRANSACTIONS ARE ADDED FROM THE
      *    APPLICATION'S LIBRARY TO THE MENU SYSTEM LIBRARY (UTPRD).
      *    THEN, THE MENU SYSTEM FILES SHOULD BE DELETED FROM THE
      *    APPLICATION'S LIBRARY.
      *
      *    THIS PROGRAM CAN ALSO BE USED TO CREATE A DUPLICATE
      *    APPLICATION FOR USE IN MULTIPLE DATABASE SITUATIONS.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

      * 1  *** MENU DESCRIPTIONS ***
           SELECT UTFLMDS1-A
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-UTFLMDS1A
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT UTFLMDS1-B
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-UTFLMDS1B
